flowchart LR
  UI[JavaFX onboarding / coach / progress]
  SRC[Camera adapter or demo landmarks]
  GATE{Required landmarks >= 0.70}
  GUIDE[Framing guidance; timer paused]
  ANALYZE[Joint angles and flexible ranges]
  COACH[At most two supportive cues]
  METRICS[Derived session metrics only]
  STORE[Local JSON]
  PERSONAL[Explainable personalization]
  SRC --> GATE
  GATE -- no --> GUIDE --> UI
  GATE -- yes --> ANALYZE --> COACH --> UI
  UI --> METRICS --> STORE --> PERSONAL --> UI

